From 3d8d2386c2077502be4642690850ae851626c4c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 11:21:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 104/108] ASoC: codecs: tfa9865: OnePlus Pad 4: charge-pump
 divider and sense mapping from stock

Two registers of the Pad 4's six amplifiers differed from the stock
container: the charge-pump clock divider in follower mode (0x62 bits 3:0:
stock 4, here 6) and the mapping of the sensed values onto the
amplifier's return slots (0x68: stock 0x0914, here the chip default
0x0820).

Write stock's values. Playback levels are unchanged: the attenuation and
the maximum boost voltage of the tables are not touched.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 sound/soc/codecs/tfa9865.c | 12 ++++++++----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/tfa9865.c b/sound/soc/codecs/tfa9865.c
index 906dfc2d4..e77e69704 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/tfa9865.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/tfa9865.c
@@ -114,7 +114,8 @@ static const struct tfa9865_reg_data tfa9865_iceland_regs_0__34_36[] = {
 	{ .reg = 0x67, .val = 0x0621 },
 	{ .reg = 0x7c, .val = 0x50f2 },
 	{ .reg = 0x63, .val = 0x90d4 },
-	{ .reg = 0x62, .val = 0x05c6 },
+	{ .reg = 0x62, .val = 0x05c4 },
